return ['domain'=>'zinn-order-updates','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-order-updates','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-09T20:34:16+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-09T20:34:16+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Order Updates'=>'Zinn® Order Updates','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-order-updates','SMS and WhatsApp order updates for your store, sent through Zinn® Campaigns under your store\'s own name. Connect in one click; no keys to paste.'=>'Taarifa za oda kupitia SMS na WhatsApp kwa duka lako, zilizotumwa kupitia Zinn® Campaigns chini ya jina la duka lako lenyewe. Unganisha kwa mbofyo mmoja; hakuna funguo za kubandika.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Order Updates'=>'Taarifa za Agizo','Your store is connected to Zinn® Campaigns.'=>'Duka lako limeunganishwa kwenye Zinn® Campaigns.','Your store is disconnected. No messages will be sent.'=>'Duka lako limetenganishwa. Hakuna ujumbe utakaotumwa.','That connection took too long or was started in another browser. Press Connect again.'=>'Muunganisho huo ulichukua muda mrefu sana au ulianzishwa katika kivinjari kingine. Bonyeza Unganisha tena.','Zinn® did not accept the connection. Press Connect again; if it keeps failing, contact Zinn® support.'=>'Zinn® haikukubali muunganisho. Bonyeza "Unganisha" tena; ikiwa itaendelea kushindwa, wasiliana na usaidizi wa Zinn®.','Your site could not reach Zinn®. Check that your host allows outgoing connections, then press Connect again.'=>'Tovuti yako haikuweza kufikia Zinn®. Hakikisha kwamba mpangishaji wako anaruhusu miunganisho inayotoka nje, kisha ubonyeze «Unganisha tena».','Help'=>'Usaidizi','Send your customers SMS and WhatsApp updates about their orders, under your store\'s own name, paid from your Zinn® credit.'=>'Watumie wateja wako taarifa za maagizo yao kupitia SMS na WhatsApp, chini ya jina la duka lako mwenyewe, zikilipwa kutoka kwa salio lako la Zinn®.','Connect opens Zinn® in this window. Sign in or create an account, approve this store, and you come straight back here. You never paste a key.'=>'Unganisha inafungua Zinn® katika dirisha hili. Ingia au ufungue akaunti, idhinisha duka hili, nawe utarudi moja kwa moja hapa. Hutawahi kubandika ufunguo.','Connect to Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Unganisha kwenye Zinn® Campaigns','Connected, but Zinn® could not be reached just now. We will try again shortly.'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini Zinn® haikuweza kufikiwa sasa hivi. Tutajaribu tena hivi karibuni.','Store'=>'Duka','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Zinn® Campaigns'=>'Zinn® Campaigns','Open for your account'=>'Wazi kwa akaunti yako','Not open for your account yet. Zinn® will e-mail you when it is.'=>'Bado haijafunguliwa kwa ajili ya akaunti yako. Zinn® itakutumia barua pepe itakapokuwa tayari.','Disconnect'=>'Tenganisha','You are not allowed to connect this store.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuunganisha duka hili.','You are not allowed to disconnect this store.'=>'Huruhusiwi kukata muunganisho wa duka hili.','Send me order updates by SMS to my phone number. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to stop.'=>'Nitumie masasisho ya agizo kwa SMS kwenye nambari yangu ya simu. Huenda viwango vya kawaida vya ujumbe na data vikatozwa. Jibu STOP ili kusitisha.','Connection'=>'Muunganisho','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'Huruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','Thank you. You can now ask for help and send reports to Zinn® support.'=>'Asante. Sasa unaweza kuomba usaidizi na kutuma ripoti kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®.','Consent withdrawn. Nothing is sent to Zinn® support until you agree again.'=>'Idhini imeondolewa. Hakuna kitakachotumwa kwa usaidizi wa Zinn® hadi utakapokubali tena.','The Zinn® AI could not answer just now. Send your question to the team below; a person will reply.'=>'AI ya Zinn® haikuweza kujibu sasa hivi. Tuma swali lako kwa timu iliyo hapa chini; mtu atajibu.','Glad that solved it.'=>'Imefurahisha kwamba hilo limetatua tatizo.','Sent. Your ticket is %s; the team replies here and by e-mail.'=>'Imetumwa. Tiketi yako ni %s; timu itajibu hapa na kupitia barua pepe.','Fill in the subject, the message and, while your store is not connected, your e-mail address.'=>'Jaza mada, ujumbe na, wakati duka lako halijaunganishwa, anwani yako ya barua pepe.','Zinn® did not accept the ticket. Check the fields and try again; if it keeps failing, e-mail support@zinndigital.com.'=>'Zinn® haikukubali tiketi. Kagua sehemu husika na ujaribu tena; ikiendelea kushindikana, tuma barua pepe kwa support@zinndigital.com.','Too many requests in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Maombi mengi mno kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena.','Reply sent.'=>'Jibu limetumwa.','That ticket is closed. Send a new ticket instead.'=>'Tiketi hiyo imefungwa. Tuma tiketi mpya badala yake.','Your reply could not be sent. Try again in a moment.'=>'Jibu lako halikuweza kutumwa. Jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi.','Waiting on Zinn® support'=>'Inasubiri usaidizi wa Zinn®','Waiting on you'=>'Inakusubiri wewe','Answered'=>'Imejibiwa','Closed'=>'Imefungwa','Report a bug'=>'Ripoti hitilafu','Send feedback'=>'Tuma maoni','Request a feature'=>'Omba kipengele','Ask for help'=>'Omba usaidizi','Versions: WordPress, PHP, this plugin, WooCommerce (and whether it uses HPOS) and the supported plugins we detected'=>'Toleo: WordPress, PHP, programu-jalizi hii, WooCommerce (na kama inatumia HPOS) na programu-jalizi zinazotumika tulizozigundua','Your active theme and its version'=>'Mandhari yako amilifu na toleo lake','The list of installed plugins, their versions and whether each is active'=>'Orodha ya programu-jalizi zilizosakinishwa, matoleo yake na ikiwa kila moja inatumika','Connection: your store address, whether it is connected, this install\'s id and whether Zinn® answered its last check (never the store\'s token)'=>'Muunganisho: anwani ya duka lako, ikiwa limeunganishwa, kitambulisho cha usakinishaji huu na ikiwa Zinn® ilijibu ukaguzi wake wa mwisho (kamwe si tokeni ya duka)','Zinn® Order Updates: Help'=>'Masasisho ya Maagizo ya Zinn®: Usaidizi','Withdraw my consent to send help requests'=>'Ondoa idhini yangu ya kutuma maombi ya usaidizi','Help here is answered by Zinn Digital® Ltd. Before anything leaves your site, this is exactly what is sent, and where:'=>'Msaada hapa unajibiwa na Zinn Digital® Ltd. Kabla ya chochote kuondoka kwenye tovuti yako, hiki ndicho hasa kinachotumwa, na wapi:','A question you type: sent to the Zinn® AI at api.zinndigital.com, which answers from the Zinn® help articles.'=>'Swali unaloandika: hutumwa kwa Zinn® AI kwenye api.zinndigital.com, ambayo hujibu kutoka kwa makala za usaidizi za Zinn®.','A ticket you send: its subject, your message, your admin language and a reply e-mail address, sent to Zinn® support.'=>'Tiketi unayotuma: somo lake, ujumbe wako, lugha yako ya msimamizi na anwani ya barua pepe ya kujibu, iliyotumwa kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®.','Diagnostics: only the blocks you tick, each shown in full before you send. Never the store\'s token, passwords or your customers\' details.'=>'Uchunguzi: vizuizi unavyoweka tiki pekee, kila kimoja kikionyeshwa kikamilifu kabla ya kutuma. Kamwe si tokeni ya duka, manenosiri au maelezo ya wateja wako.','Your tickets: while your store is connected, this screen reads your tickets and the team\'s replies from Zinn®.'=>'Tiketi zako: duka lako likiwa limeunganishwa, skrini hii husoma tiketi zako na majibu ya timu kutoka Zinn®.','We record who agreed and when. You can withdraw at any time on this screen.'=>'Tunarekodi ni nani aliyekubali na lini. Unaweza kuondoa idhini wakati wowote kwenye skrini hii.','Agree and continue'=>'Kubali na uendelee','Ask the Zinn® AI'=>'Uliza Zinn® AI','What do you need help with?'=>'Unahitaji msaada gani?','Ask'=>'Uliza','Help articles'=>'Makala ya usaidizi','That solved it'=>'Hii imetatua tatizo','Still need help? Send it to the team below.'=>'Bado unahitaji usaidizi? Itume kwa timu iliyo hapa chini.','Send it to the Zinn® team'=>'Itume kwa timu ya Zinn®','What is it?'=>'Ni nini?','Subject'=>'Mada','What happened? For a bug, the steps that show it.'=>'Nini kilitokea? Kwa hitilafu, hatua zinazoionyesha.','Reply e-mail'=>'Barua pepe ya kujibu','Leave empty to use the e-mail of the Zinn® member who connected this store.'=>'Acha wazi ili utumie barua pepe ya mwanachama wa Zinn® aliyeunganisha duka hili.','Your store is not connected, so the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Duka lako halijaunganishwa, kwa hivyo timu hujibu kupitia barua pepe.','Diagnostics (optional). Tick a block to attach it; this is exactly what is sent.'=>'Uchunguzi (si lazima). Weka alama kwenye kisanduku ili kukiambatanisha; hiki ndicho hasa kinachotumwa.','Send to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','My tickets'=>'Tiketi zangu','Connect your store to follow your tickets here. Until then the team replies by e-mail.'=>'Unganisha duka lako ili kufuatilia tiketi zako hapa. Hadi wakati huo, timu hujibu kwa barua pepe.','Your tickets could not be loaded just now. Try again in a moment.'=>'Tiketi zako hazikuweza kupakiwa sasa hivi. Jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi.','No tickets yet.'=>'Bado hakuna tiketi.','Zinn® support replied on %s:'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® ulijibu mnamo %s:','Your reply'=>'Jibu lako','Send reply'=>'Tuma jibu','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya mtumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ukaribishaji wa Zinn® kwa WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyojengwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha tovuti zaidi ya moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizodumu, vikoa na nafasi za viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili ziridhike.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — waajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii kama taaluma yao','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizo tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutuma maombi.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya usasishaji ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa sasisho hili. Angalia kuwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya sasisho ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa ukaguzi wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.']];